    "detailed_description": "\u30fc\u30fc\u30fc\u30fc\u30fc\u30fc\u30fc\u30fc\u30fc\u30fc\u30fc\u30fc\u30fc\u30fc\u30fc\u30fc\u30fc\u30fc\u30fc\u30fc\u30fc\u30fc\u30fc\u30fc\u30fc\u30fc\u30fc\u30fc\u30fc\u30fc\u30fc\u30fc\u30fc\u30fc\u30fc\u30fc\u30fc\u30fc<br><br>This work is a game created at Byking Co., Ltd. training for new employees.<br>It may not function properly depending on your PC environment.<br>Also, unintended problems may occur in the game.<br>Please take note of this.<br><br>\u30fc\u30fc\u30fc\u30fc\u30fc\u30fc\u30fc\u30fc\u30fc\u30fc\u30fc\u30fc\u30fc\u30fc\u30fc\u30fc\u30fc\u30fc\u30fc\u30fc\u30fc\u30fc\u30fc\u30fc\u30fc\u30fc\u30fc\u30fc\u30fc\u30fc\u30fc\u30fc\u30fc\u30fc\u30fc\u30fc\u30fc\u30fc<br><br><strong>Dodge, charge, attack! </strong><br>Just Box is a 2D-action game where you control a box continuously circling round a stage (and a boss). <br>While moving, avoid obstacles and enemy attacks...find your opening...and strike!<br><br>- 2-Button Control <br>Control your Box with just &quot;Dodge&quot; and &quot;Attack&quot;. &quot;Dodge&quot; incoming obstacles and attacks...<br>then charge-up and &quot;Attack&quot; right back when you see an opening!<br><br>- Perfect Dodge <br>A Perfect Dodge is executed when avoiding damage at the last possible moment! <br>Doing so powers-up your Box, increasing attack.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3046530/extras/47040a40cd482cca54c53521c5500bf0.poster.avif?t=1743408981\" width=616 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3046530/extras/47040a40cd482cca54c53521c5500bf0.webm?t=1743408981\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3046530/extras/47040a40cd482cca54c53521c5500bf0.mp4?t=1743408981\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>\u25c7Combo Attack <br>- Combo Attack When powered-up, time your press just as you land to execute a Combo Attack! <br>Combo Attacks rocket you back across the stage and if it connects, <br>you'll have a chance at dishing out a series of hits and a lot of damage!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3046530/extras/ff184c2f078fad957429e24326dfec75.poster.avif?t=1743408981\" width=616 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3046530/extras/ff184c2f078fad957429e24326dfec75.webm?t=1743408981\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3046530/extras/ff184c2f078fad957429e24326dfec75.mp4?t=1743408981\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>",
    "about_the_game": "\u30fc\u30fc\u30fc\u30fc\u30fc\u30fc\u30fc\u30fc\u30fc\u30fc\u30fc\u30fc\u30fc\u30fc\u30fc\u30fc\u30fc\u30fc\u30fc\u30fc\u30fc\u30fc\u30fc\u30fc\u30fc\u30fc\u30fc\u30fc\u30fc\u30fc\u30fc\u30fc\u30fc\u30fc\u30fc\u30fc\u30fc\u30fc<br><br>This work is a game created at Byking Co., Ltd. training for new employees.<br>It may not function properly depending on your PC environment.<br>Also, unintended problems may occur in the game.<br>Please take note of this.<br><br>\u30fc\u30fc\u30fc\u30fc\u30fc\u30fc\u30fc\u30fc\u30fc\u30fc\u30fc\u30fc\u30fc\u30fc\u30fc\u30fc\u30fc\u30fc\u30fc\u30fc\u30fc\u30fc\u30fc\u30fc\u30fc\u30fc\u30fc\u30fc\u30fc\u30fc\u30fc\u30fc\u30fc\u30fc\u30fc\u30fc\u30fc\u30fc<br><br><strong>Dodge, charge, attack! </strong><br>Just Box is a 2D-action game where you control a box continuously circling round a stage (and a boss). <br>While moving, avoid obstacles and enemy attacks...find your opening...and strike!<br><br>- 2-Button Control <br>Control your Box with just &quot;Dodge&quot; and &quot;Attack&quot;. &quot;Dodge&quot; incoming obstacles and attacks...<br>then charge-up and &quot;Attack&quot; right back when you see an opening!<br><br>- Perfect Dodge <br>A Perfect Dodge is executed when avoiding damage at the last possible moment! <br>Doing so powers-up your Box, increasing attack.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3046530/extras/47040a40cd482cca54c53521c5500bf0.poster.avif?t=1743408981\" width=616 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3046530/extras/47040a40cd482cca54c53521c5500bf0.webm?t=1743408981\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3046530/extras/47040a40cd482cca54c53521c5500bf0.mp4?t=1743408981\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>\u25c7Combo Attack <br>- Combo Attack When powered-up, time your press just as you land to execute a Combo Attack! <br>Combo Attacks rocket you back across the stage and if it connects, <br>you'll have a chance at dishing out a series of hits and a lot of damage!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3046530/extras/ff184c2f078fad957429e24326dfec75.poster.avif?t=1743408981\" width=616 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3046530/extras/ff184c2f078fad957429e24326dfec75.webm?t=1743408981\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3046530/extras/ff184c2f078fad957429e24326dfec75.mp4?t=1743408981\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>",
